Dear Ingo,

the code for this is:

truthTable(panel_QCA, outcome = "GRITC", conditions = "IQ, FRIENDS, MATEDU, SATISF, FRANCS", complete = TRUE, show.cases = TRUE, sort.by <http://sort.by> = "out")

It is a fuzzy-set QCA.

Best,
Luc

